msgid "Troubleshooting — start here"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/troubleshooting/README.md:3
msgid "Behavior Designer reports problems as sentences about _your_ objects, in the place they belong: under the formula field, under _Timing_ or _Drives_ in the inspector, on the Simulate page's readiness list, on the Deploy verdict, or as a banner when an action was refused. Each entry in this section takes one such sentence, says what it means in the design, why BDL insists, and what to do. The compiler's code for the finding is given last, for search, and can be read in the inspector's _Explain_."
msgstr ""

