msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/workflows/sensor-to-output.md:20
msgid "**The Source.** _Mappings_ **+**: `ambient`, reads nothing, produces AmbientLight — a Source; leave it without a formula. **Timing › Updates in**: _interaction_. (The Library's _Ambient Light Sensor_ makes steps 1 and 2 at once.)"
msgstr ""

#: docs/user-guide/workflows/sensor-to-output.md:24
